    "sections": {
        "description": "The Wedding Planner Blocks Theme is a beautifully designed and highly functional theme crafted specifically for wedding planners, event organizers, and bridal consultants. This versatile template is ideal for creating websites that showcase wedding planning services, including venue selection, catering, floral arrangements, decoration ideas, and more. It’s perfect for planners who want to provide a seamless online experience for couples planning their dream weddings. The theme offers a modern and elegant design with customizable content blocks to easily display different services, testimonials, photo galleries, wedding packages, and event themes. Built with a drag-and-drop page builder plugin, it allows effortless personalization of layouts, colors, and sections without coding. Features like responsive design, booking forms, pricing tables, contact pages, and social media integration ensure a professional and user-friendly experience across desktops, tablets, and smartphones. SEO-friendly and optimized for wedding websites, this theme helps attract more clients and improve visibility. Whether you’re offering wedding packages, planning consultations, or selling bridal accessories, Wedding Planner Blocks provides all the tools needed to create a visually stunning, professional, and fully functional wedding planning website."
    },
